  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": null,
    "grammar": "**Full of** is followed directly by a noun (*full of water*); many languages use a different preposition here, meaning *with*.",
    "culture": "*I'm full* after a meal is polite and normal in English; it is a common way to refuse more food.",
